  "clause_1_scope": "This standard (Part 1) prescribes the requirements, method of sampling and test for safety glass meant for general purposes, such as for use in architectural purposes, furniture, display boards, rallway coaches, earth movers, lighting fixtures, parts and components of appliances, equipments and machines etc. NOTE — Thermal shock test (as per method D of IS 6506) shall additionally be carried out in case of safety glass for appliances, as and when applicable.",
